    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2CxymQfktd2L4UuCCu6oHbY)_\n\nThe nightly tidy did not run last night, so this is a manual run for the PRs merged since the 2026-11-07 tidy (#304): #305 to #325.\n\n## Emacs changelog\n- **Notes vault tools**: #311, #314 (lint command names, ADR 0025), #315 (`sp-notes-create`/`-open`), #316, #317, #318, #320, #321 (the Denote, org-node and consult-notes removals).\n- **Links in notes**: #325 (grouped backlinks rename).\n- **Startup, load order and configuration hygiene**: #308 (`sp-ai-load`).\n- **Being developed**: new \"Grouped backlinks\" line; #324's line now says it is merged but not run on the Mac.\n\n## Root changelog (non-Emacs)\n- **Moving from yadm to Stow**: #307 (Stow guide as Org).\n- **One layer key for window managers**: #305, #306, #309, #312, #313, #322, #323 (Hammerspoon and AeroSpace), in dependency order.\n\n## Left out on purpose\n- #324 already had its line from the previous run (set date range only touched).\n- #326 was merged into the branch of #325 after #325 had merged, so it is not in `main`; it is noted under \"Being developed\", not logged as done. #327 is stacked on it.\n- Direct commit 672cd19 (commentary in the thesis dump) is not a PR.\n- The module docs' \"Changes by pull request\" sections were not extended; entries are one self-contained line each.\n\nOnly prose changed.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiD7wQRpx2GpmbAHFcA)_",
